
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>데이터의 수집과 관리 · 연습실</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#F5F6FB;
    --bg-grad: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, #EEF0FF 0%, #F5F6FB 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 100%, #FCEEF3 0%, #F5F6FB 55%);
    --panel:#FFFFFF;
    --panel-alt:#F1F2F9;
    --border:#E3E6F0;
    --border-soft:#EBEDF5;
    --text:#1F2430;
    --muted:#6B7280;
    --ink:#151A24;
    --amber:#E2A93F;
    --amber-dim:rgba(226,169,63,.12);
    --violet:#6D5DFB;
    --violet-dim:rgba(109,93,251,.10);
    --teal:#0EA895;
    --teal-dim:rgba(14,168,149,.10);
    --rose:#E24F82;
    --rose-dim:rgba(226,79,130,.10);
    --sky:#2F8FE0;
    --sky-dim:rgba(47,143,224,.10);
    --danger:#E1483F;
    --good:#0EA895;
    --radius:16px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg-grad); background-color:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR', sans-serif; line-height:1.55; padding-bottom:60px; min-height:100vh;
  }
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  .scoreboard{
    position:fixed; top:14px; right:14px; background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:999px; padding:8px 16px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    z-index:50; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(31,36,48,.08); font-size:13px;
  }
  .scoreboard #scoreText{color:var(--amber); font-weight:600; font-size:14px;}
  .scoreboard .score-label{color:var(--muted);}

  .hero{max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 28px; text-align:center;}
  .eyebrow{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(26px, 4.4vw, 40px); margin:0 0 12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .hero p{color:var(--muted); font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px); max-width:600px; margin:0 auto 30px;}

  .hero-chips{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; gap:10px; margin:0 auto;}
  .hero-chip{
    background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:999px;
    padding:10px 18px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted);
    transition:all .3s ease;
  }
  .hero-chip.on{color:var(--ink); background:var(--amber); border-color:transparent; transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .hero-caption{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:14px;}

  .tabs{max-width:960px; margin:34px auto 0; padding:0 24px; display:flex; gap:9px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .tab-btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600;
    background:var(--panel); color:var(--muted); border:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:10px 16px; border-radius:999px; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px;
    transition:all .18s ease;
  }
  .tab-btn .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; opacity:.7;}
  .tab-btn:hover{border-color:var(--border-soft); color:var(--text);}
  .tab-btn.active{color:var(--ink); border-color:transparent;}
  .tab-btn[data-target="m1"].active{background:var(--amber);}
  .tab-btn[data-target="m2"].active{background:var(--violet);}
  .tab-btn[data-target="m3"].active{background:var(--teal);}
  .tab-btn[data-target="m4"].active{background:var(--rose);}
  .tab-btn[data-target="m5"].active{background:var(--sky);}

  main{max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:36px 24px 10px;}
  .module{display:none;}
  .module.active{display:block; animation:fadeIn .35s ease;}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}}

  .module-head h2{font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,25px); margin:0 0 8px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
  .module-head .tag{font-size:12px; padding:3px 9px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--muted); font-weight:600;}
  .module-head p{color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 22px; font-size:14.5px; max-width:700px;}
  .module-head p b{color:var(--text);}

  .concept-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:12px; margin-bottom:22px;}
  @media (max-width:680px){.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .concept-card{background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px;}
  .concept-card h4{margin:0 0 6px; font-size:14px;}
  .concept-card p{margin:0; font-size:12.8px; color:var(--muted);}

  .card{background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:22px; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(31,36,48,.05);}
  .card-label{font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:14px; letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .prompt-box{background:var(--panel-alt); border-radius:12px; padding:18px; margin-bottom:16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;}

  .choice-list{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .choice-btn{
    text-align:left; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text);
    border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit;
    transition:border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .choice-btn:hover{border-color:var(--border-soft);}
  .choice-btn.selected{border-color:var(--amber); background:var(--amber-dim);}
  .choice-btn.correct{border-color:var(--good); background:var(--teal-dim); color:var(--good);}
  .choice-btn.wrong{border-color:var(--danger); background:rgba(255,107,107,.1); color:var(--danger);}

  button{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR', sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;
    background:var(--amber); color:#20160A; border:none; border-radius:10px;
    padding:11px 18px; cursor:pointer; transition:transform .12s ease;
  }
  button:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);}
  button.ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--muted); border:1px solid var(--border); margin-top:10px; width:100%;}
  button.ghost:hover{color:var(--text); border-color:var(--border-soft);}
  button.block{width:100%;}

  .feedback{min-height:20px; margin-top:8px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600;}
  .feedback.good{color:var(--good);}
  .feedback.bad{color:var(--danger);}
  .why{font-size:12.8px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px;}

  /* module2 tip box */
  .tip-box{background:var(--violet-dim); border:1px solid rgba(155,140,255,.35); border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:20px; font-size:13px;}
  .tip-box h4{margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--violet); font-size:13.5px;}
  .tip-table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12.5px;}
  .tip-table td{padding:5px 6px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06); color:var(--muted);}
  .tip-table td.op{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:var(--violet); font-weight:700; width:50px;}

  /* module3 checklist */
  .crit-list{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .crit-item{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:11px 14px; cursor:pointer;}
  .crit-item input{accent-color:var(--teal); width:16px; height:16px;}
  .crit-item label{font-size:13.5px; cursor:pointer; flex:1;}
  .crit-item.none{border-color:var(--border-soft);}

  /* module4 folder game */
  .folder-item{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px; margin-bottom:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .folder-item .txt{font-size:13.5px; flex:1; min-width:180px;}
  .folder-btns{display:flex; gap:6px;}
  .folder-btn{
    background:var(--panel-alt); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--muted);
    padding:7px 12px; border-radius:8px; font-size:12.5px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600;
  }
  .folder-btn.chosen{background:var(--rose-dim); border-color:var(--rose); color:var(--rose);}
  .folder-btn.right{background:var(--teal-dim); border-color:var(--good); color:var(--good);}
  .folder-btn.wrongc{background:rgba(255,107,107,.1); border-color:var(--danger); color:var(--danger);}

  /* module5 practicum */
  .practicum-card{background:var(--panel); border:1px dashed var(--sky); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:24px; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(31,36,48,.05);}
  .site-btn{background:var(--sky); color:#0A2233;}
  .checklist{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; margin:16px 0;}
  .checklist label{display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; font-size:13.8px; cursor:pointer; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:12px 14px; border-radius:10px;}
  .checklist input{accent-color:var(--sky); margin-top:2px; width:16px; height:16px; flex:none;}
  .progress-wrap{background:var(--panel-alt); border-radius:999px; height:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:10px 0 18px;}
  .progress-bar{height:100%; background:var(--sky); width:0%; transition:width .3s ease;}
  .progress-label{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:4px;}

  .verify-table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .verify-table th, .verify-table td{border:1px solid var(--border-soft); padding:10px; font-size:13px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;}
  .verify-table th{background:var(--panel-alt); color:var(--sky); font-size:12.5px;}
  .verify-table select{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text); border-radius:6px; padding:6px 8px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  .verify-table input[type="text"]{width:100%; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text); border-radius:6px; padding:7px 9px; font-size:12.8px;}

  .capture-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px;}
  @media (max-width:600px){.capture-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .capture-box{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:14px;}
  .capture-label{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .upload-drop{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; gap:6px;
    min-height:140px; border:1.5px dashed var(--border); border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer;
    background:var(--panel); color:var(--muted); font-size:12.8px; overflow:hidden; transition:border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .upload-drop:hover{border-color:var(--sky);}
  .upload-drop:focus, .upload-drop.target-active{border-color:var(--sky); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--sky-dim); outline:none;}
  .link-btn{
    background:none; border:none; color:var(--sky); font-weight:600; font-size:12.8px;
    padding:0; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:underline; font-family:inherit;
  }
  .capture-preview{width:100%; max-height:220px; object-fit:contain; border-radius:8px;}

  .answer-row{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .answer-row input[type="text"]{
    flex:1; min-width:180px; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text);
    border-radius:10px; padding:11px 13px; font-size:14px; font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR', sans-serif; outline:none;
  }
  .answer-row input[type="text"]:focus{border-color:var(--sky);}

  .answer-key{display:none; background:var(--panel-alt); border-radius:10px; padding:14px 16px; font-size:12.8px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:14px;}
  .answer-key.show{display:block;}
  .answer-key div{margin-bottom:4px;}

  textarea{
    width:100%; min-height:90px; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text);
    border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px; font-family:'IBM Plex Sans KR',sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; resize:vertical;
  }
  .radio-row{display:flex; gap:14px; margin:10px 0 16px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .radio-row label{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer;}
  .radio-row input{accent-color:var(--sky);}

  .summary{max-width:960px; margin:44px auto 0; padding:0 24px;}
  .summary-card{background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:24px;}
  .summary-card h3{margin:0 0 14px; font-size:16px;}
  .summary-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px;}
  @media (max-width:720px){.summary-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .summary-item{border-left:3px solid var(--border-soft); padding-left:12px;}
  .summary-item.c1{border-color:var(--violet);}
  .summary-item.c2{border-color:var(--teal);}
  .summary-item.c3{border-color:var(--rose);}
  .summary-item h4{margin:0 0 6px; font-size:13.5px;}
  .summary-item p{margin:0; font-size:12.3px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="scoreboard"><span id="scoreText">0 / 0</span><span class="score-label">정답</span></div>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Ⅱ-2-01 · 데이터의 수집과 관리</div>
    <h1>필요한 데이터를 모으고 똑똑하게 관리하기</h1>
    <p>문제 해결에 맞는 데이터를 수집하는 방법, 데이터를 검증하는 기준, 데이터를 분류·관리하는 방법을 연습해봐요.</p>
    <div class="hero-chips" id="heroChips"></div>
    <div class="hero-caption">데이터 수집의 네 가지 방법이 차례로 반짝여요</div>
  </header>

  <nav class="tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-target="m1"><span class="num">01</span>중요성</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-target="m2"><span class="num">02</span>수집 방법</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-target="m3"><span class="num">03</span>주의할 점</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-target="m4"><span class="num">04</span>분류와 관리</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-target="m5"><span class="num">05</span>실습해보기</button>
  </nav>

  <main>

    <!-- ============ MODULE 1 : 중요성 ============ -->
    <section id="m1" class="module active">
      <div class="module-head">
        <h2><span class="tag">01</span> 데이터 수집의 중요성</h2>
        <p>문제를 해결하거나 의사 결정을 할 때, <b>목적에 맞는 데이터</b>를 수집하고 분석하면 느낌이나 직관보다 <b>합리적이고 객관적</b>으로 문제를 해결할 수 있어요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">문제 상황을 보고, 가장 적절한 데이터를 골라보세요</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="impSituation"></div>
        <div class="choice-list" id="impChoices"></div>
        <button onclick="checkImportance()" class="block">확인</button>
        <div class="feedback" id="impFeedback"></div>
        <button class="ghost" onclick="nextImportance()">다음 문제 →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MODULE 2 : 수집 방법 ============ -->
    <section id="m2" class="module">
      <div class="module-head">
        <h2><span class="tag">02</span> 데이터 수집 방법</h2>
        <p>수집하려는 목적에 따라 알맞은 방법을 선택해야 해요. 대표적으로 <b>관찰, 설문 조사, 웹 검색, 공공 데이터 활용</b> 네 가지 방법이 있어요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="concept-grid">
        <div class="concept-card"><h4>👀 관찰</h4><p>사람의 눈이나 센서로 데이터를 직접 수집해요. 일상 속 문제를 해결할 때 적합해요.</p></div>
        <div class="concept-card"><h4>📋 설문 조사</h4><p>질문지를 배포해 사람들의 생각이나 정보를 효율적으로 수집해요.</p></div>
        <div class="concept-card"><h4>🔍 웹 검색</h4><p>검색 엔진에 검색어를 입력해 원하는 데이터를 찾아요. 검색 연산자를 쓰면 더 빠르게 찾을 수 있어요.</p></div>
        <div class="concept-card"><h4>🗄️ 공공 데이터 활용</h4><p>공공 기관이 공개하는 데이터를 활용해요. 개인이 얻기 어려운 데이터에 적합해요.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">상황에 알맞은 수집 방법을 골라보세요</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="methodSituation"></div>
        <div class="choice-list" id="methodChoices"></div>
        <button onclick="checkMethod()" class="block">확인</button>
        <div class="feedback" id="methodFeedback"></div>
        <button class="ghost" onclick="nextMethod()">다음 문제 →</button>
      </div>

      <div class="tip-box">
        <h4>🔎 웹 검색 연산자 팁</h4>
        <table class="tip-table">
          <tr><td class="op">" "</td><td>정확히 일치하는 결과를 찾는 단어에 사용</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="op">+</td><td>검색 결과 중 반드시 포함되어야 하는 단어 앞에 사용</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="op">-</td><td>검색 결과 중 제외할 단어 앞에 사용</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="op">|</td><td>여러 단어 중 하나 이상 포함된 문서를 찾을 때 사용</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">검색 목표에 맞는 검색어를 골라보세요</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="searchGoal"></div>
        <div class="choice-list" id="searchChoices"></div>
        <button onclick="checkSearch()" class="block">확인</button>
        <div class="feedback" id="searchFeedback"></div>
        <button class="ghost" onclick="nextSearch()">다음 문제 →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MODULE 3 : 주의할 점 ============ -->
    <section id="m3" class="module">
      <div class="module-head">
        <h2><span class="tag">03</span> 데이터 수집 시 주의할 점</h2>
        <p>데이터를 수집할 때는 <b>① 목적에 맞는지 ② 정확하고 신뢰할 만한지 ③ 충분하고 치우치지 않았는지 ④ 최신 데이터인지</b> 확인해야 해요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">아래 상황에서 어긴 기준을 모두 선택하세요 (문제가 없다면 '문제없음' 선택)</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="critSituation"></div>
        <div class="crit-list" id="critList"></div>
        <button onclick="checkCriteria()" class="block">확인</button>
        <div class="feedback" id="critFeedback"></div>
        <button class="ghost" onclick="nextCriteria()">다음 문제 →</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MODULE 4 : 분류와 관리 ============ -->
    <section id="m4" class="module">
      <div class="module-head">
        <h2><span class="tag">04</span> 데이터의 분류와 관리</h2>
        <p>수집한 데이터는 <b>폴더 구조</b>(목적과 의미에 따라 나누기)나 <b>메타데이터</b>(속성·태그를 활용해 다양한 기준으로 찾기)를 활용해 관리할 수 있어요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">어떤 방법으로 관리하는 것이 더 적합할까요?</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="classifySituation"></div>
        <div class="choice-list" id="classifyChoices"></div>
        <button onclick="checkClassify()" class="block">확인</button>
